Mask derivation (LUIcube
\f1\i _HANPPharv \uc0\u8594  mask_
\f0\i0 10pct.tif)\
Inputs: ../data
\f1\i _input/LUIcube_
\f0\i0 HANPPharv (CL per-crop, per-year 30" GeoTIFFs)\
\
Method (minimum-yearly-coverage):\
1) Yearly totals: For each year, sum all crop layers \uc0\u8594  LUIcube
\f1\i _HANPPharv_
\f0\i0 total
\f1\i _y.tif (30").\
2) Stable threshold: For each year, compute the 5th percentile of non-zero values; choose T = min of yearly 5% quantiles.\
3) Binary masks (30"): For each year, classify per cell: 1 if total \uc0\u8805  T; NA otherwise.\
4) Aggregate to 5': Area-weight each yearly 30" binary into a 5' fractional cropland coverage.\
5) Minimum yearly fraction: Take per-cell min across years.\
6) Final mask (5'): mask_
\f0\i0 10pct = 1 where min
\f1\i _yearly_
\f0\i0 fraction \uc0\u8805  0.10; NA elsewhere.\
